ProtoMotions G1 retargeting reference edition

This workspace includes a modified path-local copy of:
  protomotions/data/assets/mjcf/g1_bm_box_feet.xml
from NVIDIA's ProtoMotions repository.

ProtoMotions source: https://github.com/NVlabs/ProtoMotions
Source license: Apache-2.0; see LICENSE.ProtoMotions.

The MJCF uses Unitree G1 mesh assets.  Those assets remain under the
BSD-3-Clause terms in LICENSE.Unitree.  The model is retained as a
retargeting reference edition, not as the official Unitree description.
